The splash screen's unicorn, /usr/share/speech-kiosk/splash.png, is Noto
Emoji's U+1F984 (2D/png/512/emoji_u1f984.png of
https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji), scaled to 320x320 on black and
turned 90 degrees clockwise.

